  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "S11-QA1-005" ;
  triage:title "host_log_dir_prefers_atm_log_dir_override happy-path test is #[cfg(unix)] — no cross-platform coverage of basic override" ;
  triage:description "The basic happy-path test host_log_dir_prefers_atm_log_dir_override (home.rs:503-510) is #[cfg(unix)]-gated. On Windows CI, there is no test exercising the core override-first behavior at all. The fix for S11-QA1-002 (adding a non-gated test that sets ATM_LOG_DIR to a TempDir path without touching HOME) will also satisfy this finding — a single non-gated test covers both the headless scenario and the basic override happy path on all platforms." ;
